# UI craft — ProductName Living Instrument

When changing workspace, landing, or dock UI, read and obey:

1. [`design-system/productname/MASTER.md`](design-system/productname/MASTER.md) — source of truth: stage model, material, tokens, type, geometry, motion, anti-patterns, acceptance test
2. [`docs/design/spatial-instrument-brief.md`](docs/design/spatial-instrument-brief.md) — product behavior and anatomy (visual direction superseded by MASTER)
3. [`docs/design/ambient-dock-ui.md`](docs/design/ambient-dock-ui.md) — Peek geometry only

## Must

- Compose every screen as a **stage**: field → subject → orbit → signal. Pick the subject before drawing any surface.
- Material is semantic: **ink** for focus/study, **paper** for reading/review, **glass** for temporary chrome only (sidebar, sheets, palette, now-playing), **signal** for live feedback only.
- Tokens from MASTER §04/§06: primitives `--ink-*`, `--paper-*`, `--signal-*`; semantic `--bg`, `--fg`, `--accent` (one signal per scene), `--surface-0/1/2`, `--surface-grouped`, `--hairline`, `--ring`; radii by role `--radius-window` 22 / `--radius-stage` 18 / `--radius-sheet` 14 / `--radius-control` 10 / `--radius-row` 6 / `--radius-pill`.
- Five themes (`app/src/theme.ts`): Night `#0C0D0F` cobalt, Paper `#F3EFE7` cobalt/coral, Forest `#17201A` gold, Signal `#111522` violet→coral edge, High contrast `#08090A` yellow with no blur and 2px rules.
- Type roles: Source Serif 4 display/editorial, IBM Plex Sans utility + 17–19px prose (45–70ch), IBM Plex Mono meta. Scale tokens `--type-*`.
- Density by zone: tight ledger / medium chrome / reading / cinematic. Do not average.
- Motion verbs only on real state: settle, reveal, pulse, commit (`--motion-*`). Honor `prefers-reduced-motion` and `data-motion="reduced"`. Never `transition: all`.
- Hit 44×44. Focus `2px --ring` offset 2. No `outline: none` on controls.
- Peek dock keeps 18/14 radii and 6/14/22 spacing under `.dock`.

## Must not

- Three equal cards as the first answer; nested cards; cards inside glass; card-grid Home.
- Blanket glass; glass, blur, or animated texture behind study prose; glass over a flat radial gradient.
- Purple/indigo/cyan glow atmosphere; lime decoration; gradient text; sparkle-as-AI; emoji-as-brand.
- One radius on everything; Inter/Geist/Roboto/SF Pro as the identity face.
- Shimmer, confetti, bounce, endless loops, cursor-following noise; kinetic type in body copy, lists, errors, or nav.
- Streak/leaderboard celebration mechanics; ChatGPT transcript as Home; voice as a mic glyph or orb.
- Old Spatial values: `#1C1C1E` night, `#6B8CFF` accent, 24px panel radius, 12px control radius, Forest mint.
